BAKR: That's it, sir. Starting the scan now; stay close.

SHAW: Looks like they're onto us, Lieutenant. There's a wing of CCA forces incoming. Baker, how's that transmission comin'?

GRIG: [Off-mic, below Baker] Hostiles closing on the base as well, sir - lots of them!

BAKR: Slowly, sir. I don't know how much longer it's going to take but we've got the basics.

SHAW: [Sighs] Damnit. [Pause] Cobra One, destroy that relic. We need everything we can get from it but we cannot let it fall into enemy hands.